#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:8
#: 106a13d18efd45a59fd13cae20afbce3
msgid ""
"Names, types, and defaults come from the linked README (or `auto_declare`"
" / `declare_parameter` at the code pin when the README says so). **When**"
" tags are **Runtime** / **Startup only** / **Unverified** as in #120. "
"Framework commons (`joints`, `update_rate`, `command_interfaces`, "
"`state_interfaces`, optional `command_prefix`) are on the [how-"
"to](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#framework-common-"
"parameters) only."
msgstr ""
"名称、类型和默认值来自链接的 README（README 有说明时，则以该代码钉上的 `auto_declare` / "
"`declare_parameter` 为准）。**何时生效** 标记与 #120 相同：**运行时** / **仅启动** / "
"**未核实**。框架共性键（`joints`、`update_rate`、`command_interfaces`、`state_interfaces`，以及可选的"
" "
"`command_prefix`）只写在[操作指南](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md"
"#framework-common-parameters)。"

